      "description": "Estimate form field; blue border and halo on hover and focus.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-light\"><label class=\"ds-label\" for=\"ds-n\">Your name</label><input class=\"ds-input\" id=\"ds-n\" type=\"text\"></div>",
      "css": ":host{--ground:#1d1932;--ground-2:#262042;--compound:#f1efe9;--ink:#1d1932;--ink-soft:#4a4466;--on-dark:#efecf7;--on-dark-soft:#bdb6d6;--violet:#6d2ee6;--violet-hi:#a678ff;--form-accent:#2b6fd6;--silver:#c9cbd4;--line-light:#cdc8bd;--radius:14px;--font:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif}.ds-light{background:var(--compound);padding:24px;font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink)}.ds-label{display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:6px}.ds-input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-height:52px;padding:12px 14px;border:2px solid #8f8899;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.4 var(--font);transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}.ds-input:hover,.ds-input:focus{border-color:var(--form-accent);outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(43,111,214,.2)}"
