      "description": "How-it-works step: ink circle numeral, title, muted line.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-steps\"><li><b>Message us</b><span>Tell us what the job is and where.</span></li></ol>",
      "css": ":host{--ground:#1d1932;--ground-2:#262042;--compound:#f1efe9;--ink:#1d1932;--ink-soft:#4a4466;--on-dark:#efecf7;--on-dark-soft:#bdb6d6;--violet:#6d2ee6;--violet-hi:#a678ff;--form-accent:#2b6fd6;--silver:#c9cbd4;--line-light:#cdc8bd;--radius:14px;--font:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif}.ds-steps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:24px;background:var(--compound);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.55 var(--font);counter-reset:s}.ds-steps li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;gap:4px 14px;counter-increment:s}.ds-steps li::before{content:counter(s);grid-row:1/3;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--ink);color:var(--compound);font-weight:900}.ds-steps b{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.3;align-self:center}.ds-steps span{color:var(--ink-soft)}"
